{%- comment -%}
  Events page — lead form ("השאירו פרטים"). docs/design-log.md, 2026-08-23.

  The old page ended with a Wix contact form; here it is a Shopify
  {% form 'contact' %}, which emails the store's sender address — no app,
  no backend. The section carries id="leave-details", the target of both
  page CTAs; scroll-margin keeps the heading clear of the sticky header.

  Shopify requires a valid contact[email] on this form type, so the email
  field exists and is required even though the shop's habit is phone-first.
  The event date is a masked DD/MM/YYYY field (see the comment at the input)
  arriving in the notification email as a named line — nothing needs parsing
  out of free text. Success copy reuses the old site's "פניתכם התקבלה".
  There was an event-type select here; the owner cut it 2026-08-24 — the page
  focuses on weddings.
{%- endcomment -%}

{{ 'florista-events.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'florista-events.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{%- liquid
  assign heading = section.settings.heading | default: 'רוצים שנעצב לכם את החתונה?'
  assign sub = section.settings.sub | default: 'השאירו פרטים ולודמילה תחזור אליכם בהקדם'
  assign phone = section.settings.phone | default: '054-2270287'
  assign phone_href = phone | remove: '-' | remove: ' '
-%}

<section class="fev-section fev-lead fev-page" id="leave-details">
  <div class="fev-inner">
    {%- comment -%}
      The card wrapper makes the form read as a wedding invitation — white,
      soft radius-xl corners, a short wine rule on top (drawn as ::before,
      no extra markup). Chosen by the owner 2026-08-28 over a photo band and an
      editorial split.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="fev-lead-card">
    <h2 class="fev-heading">{{ heading }}</h2>
    <p class="fev-lead-sub">{{ sub }}</p>

    {%- form 'contact', id: 'ContactForm', class: 'fev-form' -%}
      {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
        <p class="fev-form-success" tabindex="-1" autofocus>
          פניתכם התקבלה – נחזור אליכם בהקדם. תודה!
        </p>
      {%- else -%}
        {%- if form.errors -%}
          <p class="fev-form-error" tabindex="-1" autofocus>
            כתובת האימייל חסרה או אינה תקינה. בדקו אותה ושלחו שוב.
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="fev-form-row">
          <div class="fev-field">
            <label class="fev-label" for="fev-name">שם מלא</label>
            <input
              class="fev-input"
              type="text"
              id="fev-name"
              name="contact[name]"
              autocomplete="name"
              required
              value="{{ form.name }}">
          </div>
          <div class="fev-field">
            <label class="fev-label" for="fev-phone">טלפון</label>
            <input
              class="fev-input"
              type="tel"
              id="fev-phone"
              name="contact[phone]"
              autocomplete="tel"
              inputmode="tel"
              required
              value="{{ form.phone }}">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="fev-field">
          <label class="fev-label" for="fev-email">אימייל</label>
          <input
            class="fev-input"
            type="email"
            id="fev-email"
            name="contact[email]"
            autocomplete="email"
            required
            value="{{ form.email }}">
        </div>

        <div class="fev-field">
          <label class="fev-label" for="fev-date">תאריך האירוע (יום/חודש/שנה)</label>
            {%- comment -%}
              Not type="date": a native date input displays in the BROWSER's
              locale (an en-US phone shows mm/dd/yyyy) and no attribute can
              force it. The owner asked for DD/MM/YYYY, so this is a masked text
              field — florista-events.js auto-inserts the slashes and sets a
              Hebrew validity message. The date rides along in the inquiry
              email; it drives no cutoff logic (that stays on product pages).
            {%- endcomment -%}
            <input
              class="fev-input fev-date"
              type="text"
              id="fev-date"
              name="contact[תאריך האירוע]"
              inputmode="numeric"
              autocomplete="off"
              placeholder="31/12/2026"
              pattern="\d{2}/\d{2}/\d{4}"
              maxlength="10">
        </div>

        <div class="fev-field">
          <label class="fev-label" for="fev-body">כמה מילים על האירוע</label>
          <textarea
            class="fev-textarea"
            id="fev-body"
            name="contact[body]"
            rows="4">{{ form.body }}</textarea>
        </div>

        <button class="fev-cta" type="submit">שליחת פרטים</button>

        <p class="fev-form-alt">
          מעדיפים לדבר?
          <a href="tel:{{ phone_href }}">התקשרו: {{ phone }}</a>
        </p>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endform -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Events — lead form",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "כותרת", "default": "רוצים שנעצב לכם את החתונה?" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "sub", "label": "שורת משנה", "default": "השאירו פרטים ולודמילה תחזור אליכם בהקדם" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "phone", "label": "טלפון", "default": "054-2270287" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Events — lead form" }]
}
{% endschema %}
